r this year."],[13.889,44.59,52.931,1.809,1.634,"Our Dec-27 target of ₹635 averages two methods that disagree fourfold. At 43x"],[13.889,46.034,52.931,1.809,1.634,"EV/EBITDA — a 21% premium to today’s 35x on FY27E but below the 50x"],[13.889,47.502,52.959,1.809,1.634,"trailing median of Data Patterns, Zen, Solar, BEL and HAL — on FY28E"],[13.889,48.946,52.951,1.809,1.634,"EBITDA of ₹109cr plus net cash, worth ₹1,014. A DCF (12.5% cost of equity,"],[13.889,50.39,52.931,1.809,1.634,"4.5% terminal growth) charging capex at 9% of sales and 45% of new revenue"],[13.889,51.834,52.931,1.809,1.634,"in working capital gives ₹260. The gap is the case: growth consumes cash. We"],[13.889,53.278,52.931,1.809,1.634,"rate them Underweight (Neutral: −5% to +15%). Upside: fast-track orders land"],[13.889,54.722,41.003,1.809,1.634,"early, a big export win. Downside: inflow undershoots ₹310cr."],[13.889,57.21,13.042,1.643,1.471,"Price Performance"],[15.268,66.579,1.489,1.022,0.915,"300"],[15.268,64.344,1.489,1.022,0.915,"500"],[15.268,62.108,1.489,1.022,0.915,"700"],[15.268,59.873,1.489,1.022,0.915,"900"],[18.306,67.273,2.796,1.022,0.915,"Jan 26"],[22.929,67.273,2.796,1.022,0.915,"Apr 26"],[27.701,67.273,2.47,1.022,0.915,"Jul 26"],[32.473,67.273,2.96,1.022,0.915,"Oct 26"],[18.377,68.444,4.562,1.275,1.111,"ideaForge ("],[22.942,68.47,0.618,1.241,1.111,"₹"],[23.555,68.444,0.303,1.275,1.111,")"],[26.639,68.444,7.105,1.275,1.111,"Nifty 50 (rebased)"],[19.854,69.604,1.972,1.387,1.209,"YTD"],[25.558,69.604,1.433,1.387,1.209,"1m"],[30.71,69.604,1.433,1.387,1.209,"3m"],[34.446,69.604,1.984,1.387,1.209,"12m"],[15.277,70.67,1.691,1.387,1.209,"Abs"],[18.935,70.67,2.811,1.387,1.209,"51.1%"],[24.057,70.67,2.842,1.387,1.209,"−6.3%"],[29.209,70.67,2.842,1.387,1.209,"−9.4%"],[33.527,70.67,2.811,1.387,1.209,"53.3%"],[15.492,71.735,1.476,1.387,1.209,"Rel"],[18.935,71.735,2.811,1.387,1.209,"54.3%"],[23.505,71.735,3.394,1.387,1.209,"−17.6%"],[28.658,71.735,3.394,1.387,1.209,"−13.1%"],[33.527,71.735,2.811